      "note": [
        "Statistical values and associated margins of error are not reported if the mean squared error is 50 percent or more of the statistical value.",
        "A local unit may have experienced more than one recruitment problem. Therefore, numbers and percentages should not be summed.",
        "Numbers and associated margins of error are rounded to the nearest hundred. Proportions and associated margins of error are rounded to the nearest integer.",
        "Proportions of all local units that have experienced recruitment problems in the last 6 months.",
        "The size-weighted proportion is weighted by the number of employees at the local unit based on data from Statistics Sweden’s registers, see Kvalitetsdeklaration under [Dokumentation (only available in Swedish)](https://www.scb.se/AM0702)."
